args: opentide --json lsp start --help
exit: 0

━━━ stdout
Serve the language server protocol on stdio until the editor closes stdin.

Usage: opentide lsp start [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --stdio
          Speak on stdin and stdout: the only transport, accepted for editors that pass it

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide lsp start

